    "text": "By Jeff Richards ,\n1 hours ago A motorcyclist escaped serious injury after crashing his bike at the intersection of 200 North and Airport Road in Cedar City on Wednesday afternoon. Cedar City Police Sgt. Kirk Lovell said the incident occurred shortly before 2 p.m. and involved a motorcycle driven by a man who appeared to be in his early 20s. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
